{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3937b8ddadd6cab5642e2fa6b26411ed6bc18a7095fd81ce3c23775b16ef0b53", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nうん。星梨花によく似合ってる。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n嗯，很适合星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "d80f8b85a7fb8bb9782cea5aaeb13f6ed77572c897f8e56d7d11e9f6bb153c83", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪\nあの、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "谢谢您♪\n那个，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "f4e4efea5480aae06e7ba000701c76ed55f60f1e29f1ff7e9ef5e359306809b0", "ja": "わたし、ちゃんと妖精さんに見えますか？\n自分ではよくわからなくて……。", "zh": "我看起来像真正的妖精吗？\n我自己也不太清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c14b145f2c1b58412d4d2ac60b834472cdd1ea2135d934b98632d9aadb858b99", "ja": "大丈夫。\nちゃんと、本物の妖精さんみたいに見えるよ。", "zh": "没问题。\n看起来完全就像真的小妖精一样哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "4c7f1930da0c930756794789b2f8201adb89405c92434143de5db512abb88874", "ja": "よかった……。{$P$}さんが\nほめてくれたって、パパとママにもお話しなくちゃ♪", "zh": "太好了……得把{$P$}先生夸奖我的事，也告诉爸爸妈妈才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ea2ee2477675d56ca99977de1fb88a8915443ad4a1eb43eed50b2462ce411084", "ja": "そうだな。妖精みたいな星梨花をみたら、\nきっとご両親も喜んでくれるよ。", "zh": "是啊。看到像妖精一样的星梨花，你的父母一定也会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "2beddb4a3338d57eb3e457e1c1944b88eeb4d2526e98f7d3dd84de88df150997", "ja": "本当ですか！\n早くパパたちにも見てもらいたいな～。……あっ。", "zh": "真的吗！\n我也想让爸爸他们早点看到呢～……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "3c7bea561f3cb2411d8383298f1315f212852b17ffbabc24dfc366a0ec4d3155", "ja": "聞いてください、{$P$}さん！\nわたし、『リリィ・ナイト』の夢を見たんです！", "zh": "请听我说，{$P$}先生！我梦见“莉莉·奈特”了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1012_p", "source_sha256": "083729cc58ebee4b56d23e98bb857797fc20f1cf1d099181c6d3c6ab031dcd5b", "ja": "夢？　どんな夢だったんだ？", "zh": "梦？是什么样的梦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "fd4c78a6979f7f3e00a25ad27b0e1b93270837a5ab3d5f0f97820bd4161fa41c", "ja": "えっと、あんまり覚えてないんですけど……\n百合子さんやロコさんたちと、旅をしてました。", "zh": "嗯，我记得不太清楚……\n我和百合子、ROCO他们一起去旅行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "e2b4df6e9be4be550bbaaeb747be62436e0b41f7b7099afca3147b32cac3edcd", "ja": "あと、朋花さんと亜利沙さんも！　それと、\n{$P$}さんも一緒でした！", "zh": "还有朋花姐姐和亚利沙姐姐！另外，{$P$}先生也和我们一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b8a787fdfb7a69aec6bf794dc4507d4a02a0ab0d1191bf94f25e0ad64404333f", "ja": "朋花と亜利沙も仲間とは、星梨花らしい夢だな。\nそんな中に混ぜてもらえて、嬉しいよ。", "zh": "朋花和亚利沙也是伙伴，真是很符合星梨花风格的梦呢。\n能被带进这样的梦里，真是太高兴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "afd210a81a7f62df99bedef4af9acc44b770bacc5b3cd357f30bdc656f572d4c", "ja": "冒険の世界でも、{$P$}さんは\n{$P$}さんでした！", "zh": "即使在冒险的世界里，{$P$}先生也是\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "009e6041c2444d825c1d56ae99b0f7e0c6cc7f051ba073ee99cef1d78450c44a", "ja": "わたしたちが困ってると、アドバイスをしてくれたり、\nあと、一緒にドラゴンと戦ってくれました！", "zh": "在我们遇到困难的时候，会给我们建议，\n还有，还和我们一起与恶龙战斗了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1018_p", "source_sha256": "40b6ee78ab62056bf6e4dedab9cfd9a37fd2b44d796c701cc163e8be8f7a4923", "ja": "なかなかすごい冒険をしたんだな。", "zh": "真是经历了一场相当不得了的冒险啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "ef40b3a826165e477ac0587fdc567be22ffb107f4091732fba951d09b56810a0", "ja": "はい！　わたしたち、とっても強いキズナで結ばれた\n最強で楽しいパーティでした！", "zh": "是的！我们是一支由无比深厚的羁绊紧紧相连，最强又快乐的队伍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0244_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "cd81d180c8af9735ab0b0178708f4ddef7b05a1e523028b3c66f0ef956c68a6c", "ja": "『リリィ・ナイト』のお話の続きがあったら、\n今度はみんなで冒険にでてみたいです！　えへへ♪", "zh": "如果还有《莉莉·骑士》的后续故事，\n下次真想和大家一起去冒险！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
